        ("Cyclomatic Complexity", "Thomas McCabe's quantitative software metric measuring the number of linearly independent execution paths through a function's control-flow graph", "counts decision branch points (if, for, while, and, or, except) + 1 across the function AST", "Mirror 7 ASTCodebaseAuditor, bounding unit-test effort, and identifying refactoring targets", "does not measure data-structure or domain conceptual complexity inside branchless formulas"),
