        ("Euler Column Buckling", "sudden lateral structural instability failure of a slender column or thin shell under axial compressive load below the material's compressive yield stress", "governed by Euler's critical load P_cr = (pi^2 * E * I) / (K * L)^2, depending purely on flexural rigidity E*I and effective slenderness ratio K*L/r rather than material strength", "structural steel columns, truss compression struts, and rocket fuselage shells", "imperfect initial curvature or eccentric load alignment causes real columns to buckle below the ideal Euler load"),
        ("Rankine & Brayton Thermodynamic Power Cycles", "the foundational thermodynamic heat-engine cycles powering steam power plants (Rankine) and gas-turbine jet/power engines (Brayton)", "Rankine pumps liquid water, boils superheated steam, expands through a turbine, and condenses; Brayton compresses air, burns fuel at constant pressure, and expands hot gas through a turbine (often combined into a 60%+ efficient Combined Cycle)", "global thermal/nuclear electricity generation and commercial aviation propulsion", "Carnot temperature limits require advanced single-crystal superalloy turbine blades with internal film cooling to survive > 1,500°C inlet gases"),
        ("Heat Exchanger & Log-Mean Temperature Difference (LMTD)", "thermal device engineered to transfer heat efficiently between two fluid streams separated by a solid conductive wall without mixing", "arranged in counter-flow, parallel-flow, or shell-and-tube configurations governed by Q = U * A * Delta_T_LMTD or the Number of Transfer Units (epsilon-NTU) method", "power plant condensers, chemical process integration, automotive radiators, and data-center liquid cooling", "mineral scaling, bio-fouling, and high pressure drops across tight finned tubes degrade heat transfer coefficient U over time"),
        ("Aerodynamic Lift, Airfoil & Kutta-Joukowski Theorem", "generation of fluid force perpendicular to the oncoming freestream velocity vector by a cambered or inclined airfoil body", "viscosity enforces the Kutta trailing-edge condition, establishing bound circulation Gamma around the wing such that Lift per unit span L' = rho_inf * V_inf * Gamma accompanied by lower upper-surface static pressure", "fixed-wing aircraft, helicopter rotors, wind-turbine blades, and hydrofoils", "exceeding the critical angle of attack (~15 degrees) detaches the adverse-pressure boundary layer, causing abrupt aerodynamic stall and lift loss"),
        ("Rocket Propulsion & Tsiolkovsky Rocket Equation", "reaction propulsion in vacuum or atmosphere governed by momentum conservation as high-velocity exhaust mass is expelled rearward", "achieves maximum velocity change Delta_v = I_sp * g_0 * ln(m_0 / m_f), showing logarithmic dependence on staging mass ratio m_0/m_f and linear dependence on engine Specific Impulse I_sp", "orbital launch vehicles, satellite station-keeping, and deep-space missions", "exponential tyranny of the rocket equation requires multi-stage rocket shedding so > 85-90% of liftoff mass is propellant"),
        ("Inverse Kinematics & Robotic Manipulators", "geometric and differential kinematics calculation of the joint angles theta_1..theta_n required to place a robotic end-effector at a desired 6-DOF Cartesian pose", "solves nonlinear Denavit-Hartenberg transformation chains analytically or iteratively via the damped least-squares Jacobian pseudoinverse delta_theta = J^+ * delta_x", "industrial 6-axis articulated arms, surgical robots, and humanoid locomotion", "kinematic singularities (where det(J) = 0 and degrees of freedom align) cause infinite joint-velocity commands without damped least-squares regularization"),
        ("SLAM (Simultaneous Localization and Mapping)", "autonomous robotics computational framework that incrementally builds a map of an unknown environment while simultaneously estimating the robot's pose within that map", "fuses wheel/IMU odometry with LiDAR point clouds or visual stereo features using Extended Kalman Filters (EKF-SLAM), Particle Filters (FastSLAM), or nonlinear Pose-Graph Bundle Adjustment with loop-closure detection", "autonomous mobile robots, self-driving cars, robotic vacuum cleaners, and AR headsets", "cumulative odometry drift diverges over long trajectories unless periodic visual/LiDAR loop closures anchor the pose graph"),
        ("Lithium-Ion Battery Electrochemistry", "rechargeable energy storage cell based on the reversible intercalation of Li+ ions between a layered metal-oxide/phosphate cathode (NMC, LFP) and a graphite/silicon anode", "during discharge, Li+ de-intercalates from the graphite anode through a non-aqueous carbonate electrolyte/separator to the cathode while electrons drive the external load; Solid-Electrolyte Interphase (SEI) passivates the anode", "electric vehicles, grid storage, laptops, and smartphones", "fast charging at low temperatures risks metallic lithium dendrite plating, internal short-circuit, and exothermic thermal runaway"),
        ("Photovoltaic Solar Cell & P-N Junction", "solid-state semiconductor device that converts incident solar photons directly into DC electricity via the photovoltaic effect", "photons with E >= E_g (1.12 eV in silicon) excite electron-hole pairs separated by the built-in electric field of the p-n depletion zone, tracked at peak power V_mp * I_mp by an MPPT inverter", "utility-scale and rooftop renewable solar power generation and spacecraft arrays", "single-junction silicon cells are bounded by the ~33.7% Shockley-Queisser thermodynamic limit (surpassed only by multi-junction perovskite/III-V tandems)"),
        ("Reverse Osmosis & Desalination", "membrane separation process that purifies freshwater from saline seawater or brackish water by applying hydraulic pressure exceeding natural osmotic pressure", "pressurizes pre-filtered seawater to 55-70 bar against a thin-film composite polyamide membrane while recovering brine pressure energy via isobaric Energy Recovery Devices (ERDs, ~3 kWh/m^3)", "municipal drinking water supply in arid coastal regions and semiconductor ultrapure water", "concentrated hypersaline brine discharge and membrane biofouling/chlorine sensitivity require rigorous pretreatment"),
        ("Pre-Stressed Concrete & Seismic Base Isolation", "civil structural engineering systems enhancing concrete tensile resistance and protecting buildings from earthquake ground accelerations", "pre-tensioned high-strength steel tendons place concrete under permanent compressive pre-stress to prevent tensile cracking; lead-rubber elastomeric base bearings decouple building superstructure natural frequency from seismic ground shaking", "long-span highway bridges, nuclear containment vessels, hospitals, and high-rise towers", "tendon corrosion in improperly grouted post-tensioned ducts can cause sudden brittle strand failure if uninspected"),
        ("Hydrogen Fuel Cell (PEMFC)", "electrochemical energy conversion device that reacts hydrogen fuel (H2) with oxygen (O2) across a Proton Exchange Membrane to generate electricity, heat, and pure water", "platinum anode catalyst splits H2 -> 2H+ + 2e-; protons conduct through hydrated Nafion membrane to the cathode where O2 + 4H+ + 4e- -> 2H2O at ~50-60% electrical efficiency", "heavy-duty long-haul trucking, maritime shipping, backup data-center power, and aerospace", "cathode Oxygen Reduction Reaction (ORR) overpotential losses, platinum catalyst cost/CO poisoning, and low volumetric density of H2 storage"),
